  "_approach": "Four-bar breakdown that teases the drop: a contoured 16th shaker bed runs throughout, offbeat closed hats creep in from bar 3, the open hat returns in bar 4, the kick reappears sparsely on beats 1 and 3 of bar 4 and the clap only marks 2 and 4 of that final bar - the hand-off point into a riser. Ref: modern switch-up phrasing in Darkzy / Bru-C era tracks. (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
